,"nextNodeIds":[721270102,721270104]},{"nodeId":721270102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1264309938,"text":"Very pretty indeed.","nextNodeIds":[721270103]},{"nodeId":721270103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3165,"speakerName":"Hanayama Kaoru","textMapHash":1678377634,"text":"Hehe...that's for sure. I'm taking good care of them...","nextNodeIds":[721270106]},{"nodeId":721270106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3165,"speakerName":"Hanayama Kaoru","textMapHash":770937506,"text":"By the way, can you do me a favor again? Now that the flowers are blooming so well, I was going to pick some flowers and make them into dried flowers, and send them along with letters to those who have yet to return to Tatarasuna.","nextNodeIds":[721270107]},{"nodeId":721270107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3165,"speakerName":"Hanayama Kaoru","textMapHash":2478877018,"text":"But... I don't know if it's because I had too little sleep, I just went out to pick a few flowers and I'm already so tired...","nextNodeIds":[721270108]},{"nodeId":721270108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3165,"speakerName":"Hanayama Kaoru","textMapHash":3286454050,"text":"Could you please help me pick some Sweet Flowers around here? Just three will do.","nextNodeIds":[721270109,721270111]},{"nodeId":721270109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2191725746,"text":"Okay.","nextNodeIds":[721270110]},{"nodeId":721270110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3165,"speakerName":"Hanayama Kaoru","textMapHash":2314741762,"text":"I'll leave it up to you, then. I'm gonna take a breather...","nextNodeIds":[721270112]},{"nodeId":721270112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3165,"speakerName":"Hanayama Kaoru","textMapHash":3449996490,"text":"I just want the lovely fragrance of Sweet Flowers, other dried flowers will be included in the letter.","nextNodeIds":[721270113]},{"nodeId":721270113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3165,"speakerName":"Hanayama Kaoru","textMapHash":129163642,"text":"I do believe that those who read this letter, surrounded by as pleasant a scent as it is, might at least be put in a better mood.","nextNodeIds":[721270114]},{"nodeId":721270114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3165,"speakerName":"Hanayama Kaoru","textMapHash":3530817074,"text":"I'm counting on you, then. I'll take a short break here... After you pick the flowers, please bring them to me.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":721270111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1819298482,"text":"Sweet Flowers seem to be everywhere...","nextNodeIds":[721270112]},{"nodeId":721270104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2158715978,"text":"How long have you been planting?","nextNodeIds":[721270105]},{"nodeId":721270105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3165,"speakerName":"Hanayama Kaoru","textMapHash":3979634450,"text":"It's not that long, it's just... I just sleep a little less.","nextNodeIds":[721270106]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7212701,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7212702,"order":2,"stepDescription":"","stepDescTextMapHash":0,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7212701,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_ITEM_GIVING","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"Q